{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 14 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 与神经场：表示能力、投影一致性和不可辨识性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D-to-3D &amp; Neural Fields</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_073_naf-title\">NAF</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 hash-encoded 坐标网络表示 X-ray attenuation，并用 Beer–Lambert 重投影误差逐病例优化。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Rewrites NeRF for cone-beam CT by replacing view-dependent emission–absorption with an isotropic X-ray linear attenuation field μ(x) optimized via Beer–Lambert reprojection error and hash encoding.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">稀疏视角 CBCT 投影 y、每幅投影的射线几何</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D spatial coordinates x along calibrated X-ray source-to-detector rays and sparse 2D CBCT projections y</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">连续 X-ray attenuation field mu(x) 与可查询 3D 重建</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Continuous 3D X-ray attenuation coefficient field μ_θ(x) queried at arbitrary voxel grids</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://conferences.miccai.org/2022/papers/349-Paper0974.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_073_naf')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_073_naf')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"NAF original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dda9bc53e7c559aedb0d.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_073_naf\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_073_naf')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_073_naf\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CBCT 投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CBCT projection</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">稀疏视角实测/模拟 X-ray 强度或对数投影</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d spatial coordinates x along calibrated x-ray source-to-detector rays and sparse 2d cbct projections y and prepares initial tensor representations (CBCT projection).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"稀疏视角实测/模拟 X-ray 强度或对数投影\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d spatial coordinates x along calibrated x-ray source-to-detector rays and sparse 2d cbct projections y and prepares initial tensor representations (CBCT projection).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"CBCT 投影\" data-node-name-en=\"CBCT projection\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">CBCT 投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CBCT projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">稀疏视角实测/模拟 X-ray 强度或对数投影</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d spatial coordinates x along calibrated x-ray source-to-detector rays and sparse 2d cbct projections y and prepares initial tensor representations (CBCT projection).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由源—探测器几何确定每像素 3D ray\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"锥束射线\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">锥束射线</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由源—探测器几何确定每像素 3D ray</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多分辨率 hash grid 编码 3D 坐标以加速高频拟合\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Hash within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Hash 编码\" data-node-name-en=\"Hash\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Hash 编码</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Hash</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多分辨率 hash grid 编码 3D 坐标以加速高频拟合</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Hash within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"F_theta(x) 输出非负线性衰减系数 mu(x)，不预测 RGB\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs attenuation field MLP within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"衰减场 MLP\" data-node-name-en=\"attenuation field MLP\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">衰减场 MLP</span><span class=\"lang-en\">attenuation field MLP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">F_theta(x) 输出非负线性衰减系数 mu(x)，不预测 RGB</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs attenuation field MLP within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿射线积分 p_hat=∫mu(r(s))ds，再映射为 X-ray 强度/对数投影\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Beer–Lambert within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Beer–Lambert\" data-node-name-en=\"Beer–Lambert\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Beer–Lambert</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿射线积分 p_hat=∫mu(r(s))ds，再映射为 X-ray 强度/对数投影</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Beer–Lambert within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"比较 p_hat 与输入投影 y，形成 measurement consistency\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs reprojection loss within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"重投影损失\" data-node-name-en=\"reprojection loss\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">重投影损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">reprojection loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">比较 p_hat 与输入投影 y，形成 measurement consistency</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs reprojection loss within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每病例反复抽射线、积分并更新 field 参数\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs sampling optimization within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"射线采样优化\" data-node-name-en=\"sampling optimization\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">射线采样优化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">sampling optimization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每病例反复抽射线、积分并更新 field 参数</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs sampling optimization within the core neural attenuation field cbct computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在规则 3D 网格采样 mu_theta(x)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies voxel to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"体素查询\" data-node-name-en=\"voxel\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">体素查询</span><span class=\"lang-en\">voxel</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在规则 3D 网格采样 mu_theta(x)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies voxel to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"连续场或导出的 voxel volume\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces continuous 3d x-ray attenuation coefficient field μ_θ(x) queried at arbitrary voxel grids via 3D.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"3D 衰减体\" data-node-name-en=\"3D\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_073_naf', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">3D 衰减体</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">连续场或导出的 voxel volume</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces continuous 3d x-ray attenuation coefficient field μ_θ(x) queried at arbitrary voxel grids via 3D.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"NAF Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 衰减场的 Beer–Lambert 重投影一致性</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Beer–Lambert Logarithmic Line-Integral Reprojection Consistency Over Multi-Resolution Hash Grids</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"NAF：核心公式 · 衰减场的 Beer–Lambert 重